-- title:
--   From HTo GAdjacent Stage M4 Eq Collapsed
-- statement:
--   **The adjacent $M_4$ stage collapses to averaged complete and incomplete branches.** Let $\psi$ be the two-register state, let $F$ be the indexed polynomial family, and let $k,\ell$ be natural numbers. Let $C_x$ and $I_x$ denote the total operators of the complete and incomplete parts at a uniform field point, and let $A$ denote the total of the averaged family. Assume
--
--   $$
--   \mathbb E_x C_x=A,
--   \qquad
--   \mathbb E_x I_x=1-A,
--   $$
--
--   where both expectations use the uniform distribution on $\mathbb{F}_q$. If $\mathcal M_4$ is the adjacent fourth-stage scalar and $\mathcal M_c$ is its collapsed branch expression, then
--
--   $$
--   \mathcal M_4=\mathcal M_c.
--   $$
--
--   The result removes the head outcome from the fourth-stage expression and replaces its complete or incomplete total by the corresponding averaged branch total. The collapsed expression is the form used to identify this stage with the next from-H-to-G recurrence step.
--
--   Formalization credit: Sirui Lu, Ruixuan Deng, Yanqiao Zhu, and Zhengfeng Ji (arXiv:2609.19814). Mathematical source: Zhengfeng Ji, Anand Natarajan, Thomas Vidick, John Wright, and Henry Yuen (arXiv:2009.12982).
--
--   **Formalization Note.** The source declaration is `MIPStarRE.LDT.Pasting.fromHToGAdjacentStageM4_eq_collapsed`; its Lean statement gives the exact quantifier order and all boundary hypotheses.
